      "created_date": "Saturday, April 6, 2024 at 12:29:30 PM UTC",
      "text": "Thanks for chatting with GIPHY!\n\n*Commands*:\n  `/giphy \u003cquery\u003e` _Share the first GIF that matches the query._\n  `/choose \u003cquery\u003e` _Open a dialog to choose a GIF related to the query._\n  `/random \u003cquery\u003e` _Share a random GIF that matches the query_\n  `/giphy_rating [G,PG,PG-13,R]` _Set the rating of the gifs that will be returned for this space_\n  `/giphy_rating` _Get the rating of the gifs that will be returned for this space_\n  `/giphy_feedback \u003cfeedback text\u003e` _Send feedback about the GIPHY Bot_\n\n*Help*:\n  How can I *delete* the image that GIPHY puts into a chat?\n      Click on the image and you will see the option to *delete* it.\n\n",
